  "blocks": {
    "text-1": {
      "id": "text-1",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "本讲区分代码的来源、展示与执行。源码保持在文件或 canonical code block 中，运行输出是派生结果。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "paragraph-3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "JavaScript 在隔离 Worker 中运行；Python 交互运行会首次加载 Pyodide。没有加载完成时，请看实际状态和错误，不把预录文字当成运行成功。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "highlight-code": {
      "id": "highlight-code",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "title": "sum.js",
      "value": "const values = [1, 2, 3]\nlet total = 0\nfor (const value of values) total += value\nconsole.log(total)",
      "highlight": {
        "highlight-step": [
          1,
          2
        ],
        "highlight-loop": [
          3
        ],
        "highlight-output": [
          4
        ]
      }
    },
    "text-4": {
      "id": "text-4",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "放映时按“准备数据 → 累加 → 输出”选择任意步骤。高亮由稳定 Step ID 绑定，返回上一状态也能重建。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "variant-code": {
      "id": "variant-code",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "value": "let total = 0\nfor (const n of [1, 2, 3]) total += n",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "loop-version",
          "title": "循环版",
          "value": "let total = 0\nfor (const n of [1, 2, 3]) total += n"
        },
        {
          "id": "reduce-version",
          "title": "归约版",
          "value": "const total = [1, 2, 3].reduce((sum, n) => sum + n, 0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    "text-6": {
      "id": "text-6",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "代码变体用于比较实现。引用项目历史时，可以在 origin.pin 指定真实 Git 提交；该提交必须包含目标文件，不能猜一个版本。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "text-8": {
      "id": "text-8",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "代码引用按仓库根目录寻找文件。本仓库中的路径以 examples/animations/ 开始；首次复制到工作台的新示例会重基这些引用，已有用户副本不会被改写。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "paragraph-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "region 适合教学片段；symbol 适合声明；pattern 适合精确匹配。文件变化后请检查诊断；无法找到目标时应修正引用，不能展示旧片段冒充当前源码。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "reference-region": {
      "id": "reference-region",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "typescript",
      "origin": {
        "anchor": "region:guide-code/code/checkout.ts#checkout",
        "highlightRegions": {
          "references-step": "accumulation"
        }
      }
    },
    "reference-symbol": {
      "id": "reference-symbol",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "typescript",
      "origin": {
        "anchor": "symbol:guide-code/code/checkout.ts#total"
      }
    },
    "js-source": {
      "id": "js-source",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "value": "const values = Array.from({length: Number(n)}, (_, i) => i + 1)\nconst total = values.reduce((sum, value) => sum + value, 0)\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({n: Number(n), total}))",
      "execution": {
        "when": "both",
        "args": {
          "n": "5"
        }
      }
    },
    "js-panel": {
      "id": "js-panel",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "js-panel-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "params": {
          "n": 5
        }
      },
      "children": [
        "js-source"
      ]
    },
    "text-11": {
      "id": "text-11",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "先运行 n=5，再改为 8。面板保存这次会话中的运行记录，可以选择两次记录比较实际输出和耗时。编译输出只代表构建时的参数。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "py-source": {
      "id": "py-source",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "value": "values = [n * n for n in range(1, count + 1)]\nprint(values if verbose else sum(values))",
      "execution": {
        "when": "both",
        "args": {
          "count": "4",
          "verbose": "false"
        }
      }
    },
    "py-panel": {
      "id": "py-panel",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "py-panel-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "params": {
          "count": 4,
          "verbose": false
        }
      },
      "children": [
        "py-source"
      ]
    },
    "text-13": {
      "id": "text-13",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "构建时使用当前机器的 Python；网页现场运行使用浏览器的 Pyodide。二者是不同环境，不保证安装了相同的第三方包。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "trace-source": {
      "id": "trace-source",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "value": "total = 0\nfor value in [1, 2, 3]:\n    total += value\nprint(total)"
    },
    "trace-panel": {
      "id": "trace-panel",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "trace-panel-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "steps": 9
      },
      "children": [
        "trace-source"
      ]
    },
    "text-15": {
      "id": "text-15",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "先运行“定义”，再运行“使用”。两段代码使用同一个 session。重置会话后，“使用”应报告变量不存在，这是预期的真实反馈。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "session-define": {
      "id": "session-define",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "title": "1. 定义",
      "value": "answer = 41\nprint(\"已定义 answer\")",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "session": "feature-counter"
      }
    },
    "session-use": {
      "id": "session-use",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "title": "2. 使用",
      "value": "print(answer + 1)",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "session": "feature-counter"
      }
    },
    "failure-source": {
      "id": "failure-source",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "javascript",
      "value": "throw new Error(\"这是有意触发的示例错误，请查看面板反馈。\")",
      "execution": {
        "when": "live",
        "timeoutMs": 1500
      }
    },
    "failure-panel": {
      "id": "failure-panel",
      "type": "component",
      "definitionId": "failure-panel-definition",
      "parameters": {
        "timeout": 1500
      },
      "children": [
        "failure-source"
      ]
    },
    "text-17": {
      "id": "text-17",
      "type": "text",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "paragraph-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这个按钮确实运行失败代码。超时、取消、执行器不可用与代码异常必须保持可辨认。需要 Docker、WASI、WebGPU 或远端内核的示例放在“执行环境”一讲，启用条件与能力门槛单独说明。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "reference-pattern": {
      "id": "reference-pattern",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "typescript",
      "origin": {
